WEBVTT

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:03.980
Damn you Titans!

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:08.280
Humanity was suddenly reminded that day...

00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:12.200
Of the terror of being at their mercy...

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:17.080
Of the humiliation of being
trapped inside a cage...

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:23.000
Damn you all to hell!

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:55.510
Period 12
Attack! Titan Junior High School

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:57.470
Eren...

00:01:57.680 --> 00:01:59.640
Armin, I've decided.

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:02.640
I'm going to the Titans' building
to get back our chee-burgs!

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:03.850
What?!

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:06.650
But there's no way you can...

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:07.350
- I'm coming, too!

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:08.940
- What do you think you're doing?!
- I'm coming, too!

00:02:09.150 --> 00:02:10.980
Hurry up and return to your classroom!

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:15.490
What? After all that's happened,
is the school really not going to do anything?!

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:17.490
You're Eren Jaeger, right?

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:22.540
You pledged your life to
upholding school rules, did you not?

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:24.620
- But I can't accept this!

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:25.330
- Hold it right there!

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:27.830
Anyone who rebels against
school rules will be kicked out!

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:29.710
Anyway, return to your classroom already!

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:30.290
- Whoopsie!

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:31.670
- Ow, ow, ow!

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:33.840
Just what do you think you're—

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:36.550
H-Hey, you guys...

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:39.680
You guys! What are you doing?!

00:02:39.890 --> 00:02:41.510
What do you think you're doing?!

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:46.180
What you all are doing is clearly
an act of treason against school rules!

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:47.980
Go, Eren.

00:02:48.190 --> 00:02:51.150
Everyone... Thank you!

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.400
If you're going, then I will, too.

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:55.400
Me too!

00:02:55.610 --> 00:02:58.030
The Titans' building... Man, this sucks...

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:00.530
I'm scared... I wanna go home!

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:02.490
I don't care anymore...

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:03.660
You guys!

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:05.750
Eren, what's the plan?

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:08.120
For now, let's head to the
Scout Regiment's club room.

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:10.920
I'm sure our upperclassmen will help us somehow.

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:11.210
<b>104th Attack Junior High Festival</b>

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:13.880
Stop! You brats!

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:20.510
Grisha... Today, your son has become a soldier.

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:23.510
Guys, the Titans have...

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:27.020
Quit whining about the obvious.

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:29.770
Then, the Scouts are going
to take action, right?!

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:30.980
No, we're on standby.

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:31.730
What?!

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:33.940
Tell me, what is your job again?

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:37.530
Is it simply to surrender to the emotions
you have at any given moment?

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:39.150
No, it's not.

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:42.820
But if we act now, we may even
be able to get back our chee-burgs!

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:45.200
Eren! Enough already!

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:47.580
Are you saying we have to turn
our eyes away from the fight?

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:50.790
That we should just sit back and watch
even though they took our chee-burgs?

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:54.210
Yes! I am! Do as Levi says!

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:56.250
I don't understand why we should just stay put!

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:58.720
And I don't understand why he won't explain!

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:00.220
Why?!

00:04:00.430 --> 00:04:03.760
Because Levi doesn't feel the need to explain!

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:07.930
But you don't understand that
'cause you're still wet behind the ears!

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:12.600
It's true that if the scouts act publicly now,
the club could be disbanded.

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:15.570
In the worse case, we could all
be expelled from school.

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:16.730
No...

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:19.360
I can fight on my own, actually.

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:23.320
Why do I always rely on others?

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:25.950
What are you doing, Eren?!

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:28.870
You're not in the wrong.

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.290
If you wanna do it, do it.

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:34.290
I don't know the right answer. I never have.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:36.210
Whether I trusted myself

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:39.300
or the choices of my dependable comrades,

00:04:39.510 --> 00:04:41.970
there was no telling how things would turn out.

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:47.930
So... just do the best you can and
choose whichever you'll regret the least.

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.140
Eren...

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:51.140
Trust us.

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:53.690
Hurry up! Decide already!

00:04:55.860 --> 00:04:57.190
I'm moving forward!

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:58.650
<b>The Scouts'
Main Base
of Operations</b>

00:04:58.650 --> 00:04:59.070
Eren!

00:04:59.280 --> 00:04:59.730
Hey, wait!

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:00.820
Wait for me!

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:02.280
Cock-a...!

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:05.740
<b>Empty Cans</b>

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:10.160
I never thought that I'd come here again.

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:13.580
Attack Junior High School Titans' building!

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:18.250
Just wait, you damn Titans.
I'll destroy every last one of—

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:22.170
This was a crazy idea!

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:24.680
Dammit! If we at least had our gear...

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:25.840
Eren!

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:27.180
Over here!

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:29.640
<b>School Caretaker's Office</b>

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:33.390
Are you guys okay?

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:36.810
Hm?! Mr. Hannes! Rico! Ian!

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:38.270
We brought this for you.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:40.070
It's the gear!

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:42.150
Thank you very much!

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:43.360
Uhm...

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:45.990
Aren't you gonna stop us?

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:50.200
We can't accept that they ate
our precious <i>kamameshi</i> and ran off.

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:54.040
We'll fight back and show them
how truly fearsome humankind can be.

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:55.290
Rico...

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:57.210
Once everyone sees your valiant efforts...

00:05:57.420 --> 00:05:59.710
we could reach the goal of a hundred
members in the Wall Cleanup Club!

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:01.050
<i>That's</i> what you want?!

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:02.510
Listen, Eren.

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:05.880
I'll get their attention, so you guys
use that chance to move forward.

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:07.390
Are you gonna be okay?

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:10.010
Don't underestimate me, Eren.

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:11.810
I'll play my role well... and send
you off to your chee-burgs!

00:06:11.810 --> 00:06:13.060
School Caretaker's Office

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:15.350
Mr. Hannes!

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:17.350
I'm right here, Titans!

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:20.320
Come after me!

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:27.950
Now!

00:06:28.870 --> 00:06:30.080
Listen good, Eren.

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:30.950
<b>Principal's
Office</b>

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:33.370
At the end of this hallway
is the principal's office.

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:36.000
Open the door in there with a key.

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:39.500
Your chee-burgs are there. I'm sure of it!

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:40.920
There it is!

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:44.920
So this is... the principal's office!

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:48.340
Well, I knew it wouldn't
be a normal office, but...

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:50.800
Let's go! Our chee-burgs
should be behind those doors!

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:53.300
"Attack"
Let's go! Our chee-burgs
should be behind those doors!

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:53.680
Let's go! Our chee-burgs
should be behind those doors!

00:06:57.940 --> 00:06:59.440
Where's the key?

00:06:59.650 --> 00:07:01.230
We can't find the door, either.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:03.530
Let's go search up on the table!

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:09.570
Wh-What the hell is this?!

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:12.030
Why the heck is there a town in an office?

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:13.950
Hey! Look at that!

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:15.290
It's a key!

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:17.500
Isn't that a keyhole?

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:22.880
I get it! The goal of this operation
is to bring that key to the door!

00:07:23.090 --> 00:07:24.960
This is bad! Look behind us!

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:26.760
Titans are coming in through the doors!

00:07:26.970 --> 00:07:29.470
Four of them, around ten meters high!

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:31.930
Eren! Pull the key out and open the door!

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:33.850
Everyone else, back Eren up!

00:07:34.060 --> 00:07:36.470
Just do what you can!

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:37.730
Roger that!

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:41.150
I'm gonna do this! I absolutely <i>will</i> succeed!

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:47.900
What the hell?! It won't even budge!

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:52.820
What's Eren doing?!

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:56.160
We finally caught up with them.
Are you recording it?

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.790
Yes, I am.

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:01.250
Hello, Attack Junior High School students!

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:03.670
I'm Ilse Langnar from the Newspaper Club.

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:07.300
Titans took our snack stands
at the school festival.

00:08:07.510 --> 00:08:09.300
And today, we heard that there
were some daredevil students

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:11.510
who recklessly infiltrated the
Titans' building to get them back.

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:17.350
We have also infiltrated
and are trying to report, but...

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:19.180
Eren! Hurry up!

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:20.890
Mikasa! Armin!

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:25.150
It'll be the end for all of us
if we can't get out of here!

00:08:25.360 --> 00:08:26.480
A Titan is...

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:28.440
Eren and I will pull the key out!

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:31.320
Mikasa, you keep the Titans away from here!

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:32.610
Got it!

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:40.040
Eren... We're gonna get our
chee-burgs back without fail, right?

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:41.920
Eren... Answer me!

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:45.170
Even though it'll be hell if you
go to the Titans' building...

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:48.170
And even though you might
get scolded by teachers...

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:52.130
Why did you want to go to the Titans' building?

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:53.800
Why?

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:56.890
Isn't that obvious?!

00:08:57.100 --> 00:08:58.260
Because...

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:00.260
...I was born in this world!

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:01.810
"Attack"

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:07.770
What?!

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:11.740
I'll manage somehow!

00:09:11.950 --> 00:09:13.240
Ow!

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:14.450
Jean!

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:17.700
Go already!

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:39.390
You are...

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:44.140
Blushing.

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:47.150
Look at that.

00:10:06.670 --> 00:10:10.000
My body feels like it's about
to be crushed into a pulp.

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:11.000
Eren...

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:13.170
Mikasa!

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:14.220
Armin!

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:18.760
Eren prevailed! He's trying
to fulfill his responsibility now!

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:21.470
Now if we just cover him
until he reaches the door...

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:23.390
...victory will be ours!

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:26.560
Defend him!

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:29.400
Even if it costs us our lives...

00:10:29.610 --> 00:10:31.860
...we <i>must</i> let Eren reach the door!

00:10:32.070 --> 00:10:35.070
We gotta give Eren backup! Keep 'em off him!

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:38.200
This way! Come get me!

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:46.910
From the moment we're born, we're all free.

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:51.040
There are rules that deny it,
but it doesn't matter how strong they are!

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:54.840
It doesn't matter how absolute school rules are!

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:58.510
Fight! Fight!

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:00.220
Fight!

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:05.390
I'll handle this!

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:08.310
Out of the way!

00:11:14.780 --> 00:11:17.860
I'll manage somehow!

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:24.700
Go, Eren!

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:26.950
Fight!

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:39.930
The door...

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:41.590
...opened.

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:44.600
Let's go. We should be able to find...

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:47.600
...our chee-burgs ahead!

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:52.060
Everyone...

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:55.780
Your deaths <i>weren't</i> in vain...

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:58.650
I-I'm not dead.

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:04.740
That's...

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:07.200
...our chee-burg stand!

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:09.910
This is... the gym?!

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:11.620
- Those damn Titans!

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:12.920
- Wait, Eren!
- Those damn Titans!

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:28.600
Isn't this what you call the end of the road?!

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:30.520
What should we do?!

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:38.320
Kneel down, you pigs!

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:43.320
♪ I'll rip even the future to pieces ♪

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:46.870
♪ If you seek relief, then kneel before me ♪

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:48.410
Insult us!

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:50.500
♪ If you seek relief, then kneel before me ♪

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:52.620
Bravo!

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:53.750
Kewl!

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:56.380
So they came despite all the things they said!

00:12:56.590 --> 00:12:59.340
I don't know who they are,
but this is a big help!

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:00.300
Huh?

00:13:00.510 --> 00:13:03.130
Are you stupid? No matter how you look—

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:08.180
Ah! What's that?!

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:13.640
It can't be... Th-That wall...
is fifty meters high!

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:15.480
It's one of them...

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:18.480
A Titan!

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:22.150
I get it! We're not in the gym!

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:26.070
We're inside of the principal's lunch box!

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:35.370
What do you think you're doing?!

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:36.580
Give that back!

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:38.000
Eren!

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:40.000
This is my chance!

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:42.130
I won't let it get away!

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:48.890
Hey...

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:51.430
Haven't seen you since the entrance ceremony!

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:53.680
Eren!

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:56.600
Stop!

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:57.190
Eren!

00:13:57.400 --> 00:13:59.230
Eren! Hurry!

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:02.110
I won't let you!

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:09.240
Eren doesn't taste good, you know.

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:13.040
Eren...

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:20.340
That's... Eren!

00:14:20.550 --> 00:14:20.880
Guys...

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:21.840
"Mustard"

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:25.590
I got... our chee-burg back!

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:31.140
That chee-burg bastard sure got us worried!

00:14:31.140 --> 00:14:31.350
<i>The time to fight back has come,</i> <i>climb over that wall</i>

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:32.390
Awesome!

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:33.770
He did it!

00:14:33.770 --> 00:14:33.980
<i>Like a lighthouse, ignite the light of hope</i>

00:14:33.980 --> 00:14:37.190
His eyes are saying,
"What do you think of that?!"

00:14:37.190 --> 00:14:37.400
<i>Like a lighthouse, ignite the light of hope</i>

00:14:37.400 --> 00:14:38.190
Eren...

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:41.230
They completely disregarded school rules.

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:41.440
<i>That enormous strength is precisely</i>
<i>what leads the way to freedom</i>

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:43.530
Do they really think it's okay
to go against the principal?!

00:14:43.530 --> 00:14:45.110
<i>Let's look beyond this conflict, Ausfall!</i>

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:49.570
But I think that we now have a
big chance for the human students

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:53.080
to have a fun school life.

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:57.960
We never imagined that we humans
would go against Titans before.

00:14:58.170 --> 00:14:58.750
Given that, the fact that human students
took a chee-burg back from Titans

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:02.130
<i>Inside the wall, with no place to run,</i>

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:03.750
is a big step forward.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:03.960
<i>Inside the wall, with no place to run,</i>

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:04.380
Right, now is the time
to reconsider the school rules.

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:08.300
<i>we're stuck in restrictions and exploits</i>

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:10.050
Let's take a close look at them anew

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:10.600
<i>Even if our glory days of youth get trampled upon,</i>

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:14.600
in order for the students trapped inside
the walls to have a fun school life.

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:16.680
<i>I want to at least hold on to the future</i>

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:19.480
This time, it's our turn to attack!

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:19.690
<i>I want to at least hold on to the future</i>

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:25.900
<i>I won't give in to that absurd scolding voice, either</i>

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:26.030
Chee-burgs! Chee-burgs! Chee-burgs! Chee-burgs!

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:28.910
<i>I pledged to the earth that I'd make</i>
<i>our dreams and hopes come true</i>

00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:30.780
Yummy!

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:37.000
<i>The time to fight back has come,</i>
<i>the blood in my veins calls forth the future</i>

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:42.790
<i>We'll pull apart all those troublesome rules</i>

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:48.260
<i>Now's the time to raise the flag</i>
<i>of revolt upon that steep wall</i>

00:15:48.470 --> 00:15:53.890
<i>Seek prosperity, Ausfall!</i>

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:06.230
<i>A heart that no one understands</i>

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:11.860
<i>will still burn hot like a flame</i>

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:16.540
<i>Although we are cruelly humiliated,</i>

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:22.080
<i>we're determined to break through it someday</i>

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:27.960
<i>No matter how deep I may fall into despair,</i>

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:33.590
<i>I can stand up as many times as it takes,</i>
<i>because I have friends</i>

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:39.060
<i>Make the vow to fight and grab your sword</i>

00:16:39.270 --> 00:16:44.810
<i>no matter what enemy we may be up against</i>

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:50.360
<i>Shall we sing of our triumphant return,</i>
<i>for the sake of our wounded friends?</i>

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:55.990
<i>To our bond, Singen!</i>

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:57.990
"The End"

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:00.000
<b>Attack on Titan: Junior High</b>
